{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47040","headline":"行路难 · 齐己","name":"行路难","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"行路难，君好看。\n惊波不在黤黮间，小人心里藏崩湍。\n七盘九折寒𡺚崒，翻车倒盖犹堪出\n未似是非唇舌危，闇中潜毁平人骨。\n君不见楚灵均，千古沉冤湘水滨。\n又不见李太白，一朝却作江南客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47040.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47040","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}